  "notes": {
    "source": "All pins come from the read-only ATM10 8.1 reference instance at E:/curseforge/Instances/All the Mods 10 - ATM10. SHA-1 matched its CurseForge metadata; licenses, dependency ranges and sides were read from each JAR. No reference-pack configuration, script, quest or asset is included.",
    "dependencyClosure": "New libraries: YUNG's API, Cristel Lib (Towns and Towers) and Lionfish API (Cataclysm). Architectury and Curios were already pinned.",
    "worldgen": "YUNG's Better modules replace vanilla structures instead of adding a second set; Towns and Towers, Explorify, Hellish Trials and Cataclysm are the only additive overworld/Nether structure sets. No biome overhaul is added. Deeper and Darker adds the Otherside below ancient cities.",
    "exclusions": "Structory and Structory Towers, The Undergarden, When Dungeons Arise, Mo' Structures, Moog's structure packs, Formations, Underground Villages, Illager Warship, Eternal Starlight, Ice and Fire, Nullscape and Repeatable Trial Vaults stay out; reasons are in the family design note."
  }
